// Modus standard library prelude (std:prelude)
//
// Implicitly loaded into every build (like a compiler prelude). This file is
// a single barrel: it re-exports its home modules' public surface — including
// the operator trait impls (`Eq`/`Add` for `String`) that `==`/`!=`/`+` lower
// to — so every program sees them without an explicit import. Keep the
// re-export list minimal: every module pulled in here is compiled into every
// program.

export * from "std:string";
